# Project structure

Full reference: `.cursor/ARCHITECTURE.md`, `.cursor/FEATURE-MAP.md`

## Active structure

```txt
src/
├── pages/                  # Pages Router — _app, _document, index
├── providers/              # AppProviders (theme + context composition)
├── context/                # ActivityContext (app state)
├── components/             # Shared UI (EmptyState, LoadingState, ErrorState, PublicHeader)
├── layouts/PublicLayout/   # 3 files only — shell via getLayout
├── modules/WorkforceActivity/  # Feature UI, hooks, models, constants
├── shared/constants/       # Minimal shared constants
├── shared/utils/           # Reusable utilities (datetime, gaps, timeline merge)
├── shared/services/        # Domain services (parse, analyze, filter, charts, storage)
├── styles/                 # Global SCSS + Tailwind entry
└── theme/                  # MUI theme (Geist fonts)
```

## Module anatomy

```txt
src/modules/WorkforceActivity/
├── components/
├── hooks/
├── models/
├── constants/
├── WorkforceActivity.tsx
└── WorkforceActivity{Upload,Dashboard,AssociateDetail}.tsx
```

Reusable utilities → `src/shared/utils/`. Domain services → `src/shared/services/`. App context → `src/context/`.

## Import direction

```txt
app → modules → context / shared / components / hooks / models
```

`src/shared/utils/` and `src/shared/services/` must not create circular imports — if they need domain types, keep types in `src/shared/models/` or accept a temporary import from the owning module.

## Inactive (ignore / do not extend)

- `src/pages/`, `src/apis/`, `src/configs/request.ts`
- `src/modules/Users/`, `Home/`, `Introduction/`
- Auth, react-query, axios patterns from boilerplate

## Styling

- MUI theme tokens + Tailwind `@apply` in `*.module.scss`
- Design: warm monochrome — see `.cursor/.agents/skills/minimalist-ui/SKILL.md`
